#: operators/merge.py:24
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Merge active shape key with all other shape keys above or below it.\nWARNING: If shape key values are animated, merged shape key will inherit the animation of active key.\nRest of the animation will be lost, as well as other properties from merged shape keys"
msgstr "将活动形态键与其上方或下方的所有其他形态键合并。\n警告：如果形态键值已制作动画，合并后的形态键将继承活动键的动画。\n其余动画以及被合并形态键的其他属性都将丢失"

#: operators/merge.py:116
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Merge active shape key with shape key above or below it.\nWARNING: If shape key values are animated, merged shape key will inherit the animation of active key.\nRest of the animation will be lost, as well as other properties from merged shape keys"
msgstr "将活动形态键与其上方或下方的形态键合并。\n警告：如果形态键值已制作动画，合并后的形态键将继承活动键的动画。\n其余动画以及被合并形态键的其他属性都将丢失"

#: operators/objects.py:13
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Objects from Shape Keys"
msgstr "从形态键创建物体"

#: operators/split.py:22
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Split Shape Key"
msgstr "拆分形态键"

#: operators/split.py:23
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Split active shape key into two parts based on edit mode selection"
msgstr "根据编辑模式选择将活动形态键拆分为两部分"

#: operators/copy.py:11
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Transfer shape keys from selected objects to active object\nVertex positions are transferred by index. Different number of vertices or index will give unpredictable results"
msgstr "将形态键从所选物体传输到活动物体\n顶点位置按索引传输。顶点数量或索引不同将导致不可预测的结果"
